          uiMapID=254, x=0.39480799437, y=0.79303199053, rootSection=4584,
          desc="Very few of the Dark Horde have seen the reclusive and unpredictable Gizrul. The beast emerges from his shadowy den only when his mate, Halycon, calls to him. The two monstrous creatures have produced some of the largest--and most ferocious--worgs ever bred in orcish history.",
