              body="The Unforgiven channels a wave of pain and sorrow into the victim, slowing the target by $122832s2% and inflicting $122832s1 Shadow damage every $122832t1 sec for $122832d." },
            { id=6217, title="Vengeful Phantom", parent=0, child=6463, sib=0, order=2, spell=0, icon=0, flags=3, cdisp=146,
