        { id=11032, name="Commander Malor", order=4,
          uiMapID=317, x=0.29932001233, y=0.40799999237, rootSection=6452,
          desc="Malor and a handful of other courageous warriors risked everything to protect the Scarlet Bastion from being desecrated by the undead. Tragically, they failed. Balnazzar corrupted the fearless commander into one of his servants, transforming the zealot into a mockery of his former self.",
